{"time": 1767599792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192275032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然对我们而言是初来乍到...不知道故地重游是什么心情...\""}
{"time": 1767599903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109055881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "甜品店面的占地面积更小了，一楼刨去工作区，总共也就四张桌子。这个点客户不多，但二楼有更开阔的视野。此外甜品的种类相当丰富"}
{"time": 1767599974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985704936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "从糕点、冷饮到甜粥，一应俱全"}
