{"time": 1767601138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847059662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉觉得呢”"}
{"time": 1767601157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968009124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...?\"抬头扫一眼，随后轻轻摇头，\"不清楚呢...不过...进去的事之后再说吧。\""}
{"time": 1767601386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225900340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现在的话...\"调整一下表情，笑着捧着蛋糕走到桌边放下，\"餐前的慰问——\"坐回母亲身边，\"算是女儿迟来的夺冠庆祝?之前的参与不了嘛。\""}
{"time": 1767601700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089955669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐回自己的位置"}
