{"time": 1767605549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8277800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1993033019]😋好吃，转头看向舒茉“用不用帮你也剥下”"}
{"time": 1767605606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086497165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "刚刚咬掉虾头，剩下的准备直接吃，\"唔...\"听完话一时有些呆住，\"呃...需要剥壳吗？\""}
{"time": 1767605641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233754707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "被干煸过的虾肉依然不失弹性。去壳之后咸味锐减，倒是凸显了鲜甜的本味"}
{"time": 1767605759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092174422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虾壳补钙.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767605833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731951761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“都行？”舒蕾完全是另一个极端，连虾头都没去，一同塞进嘴里，嚼得咔呲作响"}
{"time": 1767605927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371717", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虾头好硬诶，容易划破嘴。\"咀嚼咀嚼，\"和河里的好像没什么区别?\"皱眉"}
{"time": 1767606036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452344114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你在说什么，河里哪有这么大的虾）"}
