{"time": 1767636291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769135397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=AFDFF1E53D311690531A09BF7AA6F2F7.jpeg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSNL6M5IzkIuNIsaFu0lLeCGYLFiRiwngEg_wooupSoqf70kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQHbTRl5z_EDrAHfx1wLJxL3oCcjeCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMAQgMZI3eOaKDBaacVAnesRlAztc-sNxRssl29weltL6iLVdaHeuVySRJdbPnZLgwA,file_size=20272]"}
{"time": 1767636585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242989655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉不是我动啊）"}
{"time": 1767636634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124041887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1416618645]舒蕾走在你前面，汉斯跟在你后面。新居不远，也不是独间，而是在某栋水泥砌起的二楼。一楼是一间商住一体的小店铺，因此大了一些。也因此二楼除了住所有一个小平台"}
{"time": 1767636874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113909505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就是这儿啦，我去找房东签约拿钥匙”"}
{"time": 1767636980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404907143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "困乏，没睁开眼，趴得安安静静。"}
{"time": 1767637005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421253365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "仔细记一下周围的建筑，别之后找不到了"}
{"time": 1767637089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718482919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们希望楼下是什么店）"}
{"time": 1767637122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1120047635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（甜品店（bushi）"}
{"time": 1767637177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362085242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（楼下是食品店会很麻烦（）"}
{"time": 1767637339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019439465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(最理想应该是服装店吧)"}
{"time": 1767637351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001055993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(或者首饰店)"}
{"time": 1767637360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537048462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(食品的话半夜开工)"}
{"time": 1767637514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639230961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且养蟑螂（）"}
{"time": 1767637524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002948354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之没一会舒茉就拿了钥匙回来了"}
{"time": 1767637623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436748646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "开门，推门。屋子里因为作业的雨有一股很淡的潮气。木头沙发上铺好了坐垫，桌上和地面倒是没积什么灰"}
{"time": 1767637694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1690638528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "房屋的布局和之前在未白镇的房子有几分相像"}
{"time": 1767637734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670572003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看几室几厅"}
{"time": 1767637763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435342243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "三室一厅，带厨卫"}
{"time": 1767637832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664281469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "脑袋自然地搭在伊恩的肩膀上，连带着垂落下的长发，几乎已经睡着了，发出了一些咕噜咕噜的声音。"}
{"time": 1767637908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434750081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“阿姨，房间怎么分？”看向舒蕾"}
{"time": 1767638012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067698628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦？”她颇为警惕地盯着你看“你想怎么分？”"}
{"time": 1767638199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814208995", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃....我睡客厅就行...”"}
{"time": 1767638210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043168150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1767638223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941271051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是人类吗）"}
{"time": 1767638266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464315837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“叔叔阿姨睡一间，我和舒茉一人一间...这样？”"}
{"time": 1767638303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030089430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后东边的归叔叔阿姨，舒茉睡中间，剩下的那间归我...”"}
{"time": 1767638463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641495011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“反正都差不多”她稍有些无语“两间小的你们自己分配吧。如果莫辛她们要来就……再说”"}
{"time": 1767638544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142549242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "背着舒茉打开中间房间的门"}
{"time": 1767638755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351065666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "身上带着些酒气，总归有点不舒服，但是又不想醒，只是皱着眉。"}
{"time": 1767638998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046849595", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把舒茉放到床上，然后小心为她盖好被子..."}
{"time": 1767639009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949087741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "房间不算大，但足以容纳一张双人床、一张桌子和一个衣柜，还有些许归属感。只不过现在床上光秃秃地只有床板"}
{"time": 1767639019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351817200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然还没有被子）"}
{"time": 1767639040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62942672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的（）"}
{"time": 1767639071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637238422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "只能先把舒茉放客厅的沙发上了，然后帮她铺床！"}
{"time": 1767639132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700015495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "沾到沙发倒是很快就睡着了，虽然有些瑟缩。"}
{"time": 1767639454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756910869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（洗个澡）"}
{"time": 1767640058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070025987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "多少还是带了些床上用品的，不过明天还得再采买一些……说是这么说，大概没过几天就要去学院住了吧？"}
{"time": 1767640070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838393632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之没花太多功夫就铺好了"}
{"time": 1767640116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700139051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "再去小心的把舒茉抱到床上，给她盖好被子，随后再去烧点开水"}
