{"time": 1767664854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536197469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "某人的房间大概气味不会那么好闻"}
{"time": 1767664873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98203133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像似乎没什么事，多睡会"}
{"time": 1767664950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428946169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那么你大概能听见两人开门出去了的声音"}
{"time": 1767665196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067730039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "头有些疼，虽然有些迷糊，但是想要再睡下去又有些困难，睁开眼打量一下四周"}
{"time": 1767665410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480724855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "日出东方，你的房间恰好朝阳，融化了些屋内冷寂的灰白。桌面上空无一物，你的玩偶和吊饰都不在这儿。墙根堆着两包行李，而你身上只盖着层毯子——好在？衣服还在，所以不至于受寒"}
{"time": 1767665676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214030217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "坐起身抱紧毯子，脑海里缺乏已经住进新家的实感，\"呃...\"渴得有些难受，嗓子干干的，起床去客厅"}
{"time": 1767665885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226815714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "客厅的家具比伊恩那还没捂热乎的新家比也好不到哪去，几乎算是一清二白，不过至少还是有水的"}
{"time": 1767666010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042329671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接一杯水喝一口，去洗漱间看看自己的样子，昨晚似乎在路上就睡了过去，整个人身上都不太好闻，还有一股咸味海鲜和酒精的气味。"}
{"time": 1767666077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462619570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "岂止，鞋子上还沾着泥巴，你上次洗澡更得追溯到赫顿玛尔"}
{"time": 1767666375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085330737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着眉看着镜子里的自己，认命地摇摇头，回房间里拆分行李，拿出一套常服，先烧热水。"}
{"time": 1767666464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390798178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "实际上屋子里并没有备煤炭.jpg"}
{"time": 1767666522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919530901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那不寄了吗)"}
{"time": 1767666569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229662485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊恩会烧的.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767666582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862365245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"简单打理一下头发，换洗的衣服打包一下，出门找找浴场。"}
{"time": 1767666620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020062623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那么伊恩听到第三个人出门的声音"}
{"time": 1767666635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535427403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好吧其实在客厅里折腾也肯定听得见的）"}
