{"time": 1767667936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14723064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抱着衣服进浴室，先接好冷水，同时处理自己鞋子上的泥土和污渍"}
{"time": 1767668011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029877253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么”去帮舒茉烧水"}
{"time": 1767668114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974708803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "起码小皮鞋上没有那么多镂空和褶皱，洗起来还算方便。另一边，烧热足够泡人进去的一桶水也消耗了伊恩近半的魔力"}
{"time": 1767668234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524268822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些郁闷地看着湿着的鞋子，\"这么一说才注意到...昨天舒茉完完全全就是小丫头的样子吧...\""}
{"time": 1767668336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041170949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过很可爱呢...”擦擦额头的汗“好了，烧好了..”"}
{"time": 1767668514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421021132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是...\"看着氤氲的水汽，伸手试一试水温，\"呼呼，辛苦伊恩了。\"作势解开扣子，准备脱衣服。"}
{"time": 1767668585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023373699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自觉离开..坐到客厅沙发上休息一会"}
{"time": 1767668629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475316376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么该脸红的时候不脸红（））"}
{"time": 1767668643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881608294", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为直走了接）"}
{"time": 1767668650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461501762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为直接走了）"}
{"time": 1767668673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594425048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎木头）"}
{"time": 1767668711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328329397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻笑一声，关好门，脱完衣服扎好头发，先是脚尖再是整个身体浸入水中，发出了满足的叮咛声。"}
{"time": 1767668857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390669991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在客厅也可以听到水声，想到了之前看过的一本小说里的话，不过现在也不是饭点...不知道该怎么形容这种感觉"}
{"time": 1767668880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678305887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（看笑了）"}
{"time": 1767668897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81945622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是怎么不是饭点，早饭不是饭？）"}
{"time": 1767668944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121988617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=390669991](什么小说?)"}
{"time": 1767668975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678894743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不记得是加速世界还是啥了）"}
{"time": 1767668989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728151096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之听声下饭）"}
{"time": 1767668994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866292626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也可能是DAL）"}
{"time": 1767669002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509442749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "应该有配肥皂吧？餍足地眯着眼，伸手找一找"}
{"time": 1767669022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691120884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是兔女郎学姐啦）"}
{"time": 1767669037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289509640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（听麻衣学姐洗澡可以下三碗饭）"}
{"time": 1767669154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673369594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "透过百叶窗的缝隙，薄而柔软的碎云白的发亮，嵌在空明的天幕上，让人忍不住想大口呼吸，全身心拥抱这难得的好天气。另一边，坐在客厅的伊恩听到脚步渐进，有人敲门"}
{"time": 1767669178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015626490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1509442749]可能，就当有吧.jpg"}
{"time": 1767669279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908618329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "咦？莫非是莫辛她们吗，过去开下门看看什么情况"}
{"time": 1767669368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314708008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "当然是舒蕾汉斯买完日用品和早点回来了.jpg"}
{"time": 1767669374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976605671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "肥皂打一打热水，开始擦拭身体，誓要把之前的疲惫，尤其是昨晚的酒气洗掉，随后就安静地泡在水里享受此刻的闲暇。"}
{"time": 1767669392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631682848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1314708008]（那敲门是何意（）"}
{"time": 1767669403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456925438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哟，醒啦？”两个人胳膊上和怀里都满满当当，难怪没手拿钥匙"}
{"time": 1767669419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497466342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（家里有人敲门当然比拿钥匙方便啊）"}
{"time": 1767669450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050572256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，叔叔阿姨早上好，舒茉也醒了，不过现在在洗澡”"}
{"time": 1767669492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351301711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我帮你们拿一些吧”从他们手里接过一些东西，然后找地方放下"}
{"time": 1767669630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908533155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们早餐想吃什么）"}
{"time": 1767669648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139456044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（胡辣汤（bushi）"}
{"time": 1767669650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766030572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然听见了客厅的对话，不过没接话，闭上眼泡在水里。"}
{"time": 1767669658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521000692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(居然也行吗)"}
{"time": 1767669667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73928452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是我不要木耳)"}
{"time": 1767669844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617471319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "打扫工具、衣架衣绳、还有几幅餐具……看起来离把这个屋子打理成家还有点距离，还得再跑几趟，不过当务之急是……“嗯，是该洗洗，你们中午还要见人的吧？不管她了，先来吃早饭”"}
{"time": 1767669864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877495558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有塑料的年代，外卖一般用什么装）"}
{"time": 1767669873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919044775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(盒子?)"}
{"time": 1767669878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714108379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉是木盒子)"}
{"time": 1767669943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322537818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯”坐到餐桌前准备吃饭"}
{"time": 1767669968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883965316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那还挺贵的，正好当买碗了）"}
{"time": 1767670100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34182727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "木头的便当盒里装着热乎的肉包和汤品。为了解腻在肉包旁还塞了些甜辣口的盐菜"}
{"time": 1767670304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492699250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看起来蛮有食欲的样子“我开动了”然后吃饭，隐隐约约还能听到水声，感觉食欲大增（bushi）"}
{"time": 1767670323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139799674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不急着从水里出来，热水没有冷下来之前都不打算有什么动作了。"}
{"time": 1767670341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289105590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那个脸扁的表情包呢.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767670392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117850810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（到了学院你们会发现每个浴室都会配一个魔力热能转换器（））"}
{"time": 1767670752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026282624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不过作为收尾工作果然还是...解开头发的扎绳，开始仔仔细细地处理长长的头发，趁着水尚温的时候洗好，站起身的时候只感觉冷气扑面而来，\"嘶...\"不由得发出很响的声音。"}
{"time": 1767670767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446226708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=492699250]包子用料还算扎实，面的部分也松软带着些油香。自从离开未白，伙食这块倒是没差过"}
{"time": 1767670935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061201564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1026282624]（很响的声音是什么动静）"}
{"time": 1767670948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072818408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(倒抽一口冷气的声音吧)"}
{"time": 1767670953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409962366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我觉得舒蕾应该是见怪不怪的（）"}
{"time": 1767671151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165304654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "擦干水渍，拥毛巾包着头发，穿好换洗的衣服，感觉浑身舒爽，虽然头发还是湿的，推开浴室的门，\"早上好!\""}
{"time": 1767671523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216354249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(该吃饭了（)"}
