{"time": 1767685146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932938747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（人站在车顶跳一下肯定还是相对静止，那飞起来呢（）"}
{"time": 1767685185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453386192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（考虑空气阻力的话其实跳起来也不是相对静止）"}
{"time": 1767685210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402897035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其次飞起来就有额外的力影响了，那不是看你往哪飞吗）"}
