{"time": 1767690140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（魔法协会，冒险家协会，商业区，大图书馆，摩伽陀总部，学院，码头，工业区）"}
{"time": 1767690212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118461789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不急啦...\"闭上眼睛，\"休息一会嘛。\""}
{"time": 1767690226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322807758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"过一个小时就该出门了。\""}
{"time": 1767690250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365975915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（应该还有一个三番街，属于鱼龙混杂的老街区吧）"}
{"time": 1767690428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830311369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...那就休息一下好了”看舒茉那么想睡觉就赞同她吧"}
{"time": 1767690579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371090543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘿嘿...\"憨笑了几声，在母亲肩头开口，\"妈妈帮我弄一下被子嘛。\"撒娇的语气"}
{"time": 1767690775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704193480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，就该告诉你们一觉起来11点了）"}
{"time": 1767690915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288501912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行啊，你在旁边也看看，到时候去了学校就该自己弄了”舒蕾吃完早饭洗干净手，从刚买的袋子里翻出被芯"}
{"time": 1767691043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801560900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟在一旁，\"唔...\"虽然说是看着，实际还是帮忙给被芯套上被套，\"醒过来床边都是空空荡荡的...\"撇撇嘴"}
