{"time": 1767723861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340264092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你要测就别交（）"}
{"time": 1767723944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493884940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我还是等待测试吧...\"犹豫了一下还是没有把表交上去，深吸一口气开口。"}
{"time": 1767724049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662011020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，一般来说填表的流程都是在学院做的”阿尼亚在收起伊恩的单子之前确认了一遍“交了就不能轻易改了哦”"}
{"time": 1767724126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320345352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...就这样吧”"}
{"time": 1767724157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589957549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（洗澡）"}
{"time": 1767724791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795235464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也行。事不宜迟，现在就先去学院？”阿尼亚收起伊恩的档案"}
{"time": 1767725064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761988783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"自然是没什么意见，不过有些紧张，咬了咬唇"}
{"time": 1767725186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251600563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"阿尼亚姐姐带路吧...\""}
{"time": 1767725226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951810368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯”阿尼亚起身，转头看了看一直插不进话题的舒蕾，收起一直以来的浅笑，点头致意，随后带起路来“跟我走吧。”"}
{"time": 1767725227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958108330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“拜托了”"}
