{"time": 1767754097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782687939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥大概十一点起是一种习惯吧)"}
{"time": 1767754331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089407049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=194933880]阿尼亚领着你们出了商会，实际上无需带路，每个人都能看见西海岸占地面积最大的建筑群在哪。"}
{"time": 1767754537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在心里告诫自己要保持仪表，之后不能一惊一乍，偷摸着和母亲靠近了一些，扶着她的手臂。"}
{"time": 1767754610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796577424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "靠近舒茉一点"}
{"time": 1767754955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315507747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "现在应该是午休时间，大概是受扩招影响，临近学院的街道上人流量不算少。而隔着深蓝色的金属栅栏，校园内高大而彰显想象力的建筑物也尽收眼底。四色承重柱支起的方正大楼顶端，一个环状结构散发着不规则的光晕，变换的颜色具象化着元素力的浓度，此刻占据上风的自然是火红与金黄。然而这座最为显眼的建筑还不是最高的那栋，西角，沉默的黑色圆柱矗立在山巅，像仰视星海的望远镜，而顶端的球体又好像在注视脚下大地的眼睛"}
{"time": 1767754992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538788876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（金黄是什么属性，光吗）"}
{"time": 1767755043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592223943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（光啊）"}
{"time": 1767755052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "151501601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个建筑是什么啊”好奇指着那个圆柱"}
{"time": 1767755163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380831476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(索伦之眼?)"}
{"time": 1767755240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687819950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...看着像是什么塔?\"盯着那边看，\"难不成是天文台之类的吗？\""}
{"time": 1767755261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256750939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那边是占星科的教学楼，为了降低光污染的影响当然要建得够高，当然，也是占星术士的毕生追求……离星空更近一些嘛”"}
{"time": 1767755295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823670626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊，舒茉真厉害”"}
{"time": 1767755454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230658631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是瞎猜的啦。\"腼腆地笑了笑，\"那现在是不是情况有变?有更好的塔出现了\""}
{"time": 1767755698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21728954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果能上得去的话，也许……不过如果能抵达天界的话，近几百年的天体科成果可能都要重新评估了吧？”阿尼亚侃侃而谈“已经有人在焦虑了，好像还有人抱怨天空之塔正好挡住了他的毕业论文……”"}
{"time": 1767755801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043070219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那很惨了...”"}
{"time": 1767755902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117768956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...那可能要慎重考虑选不选占星科的事了。\"听到伊恩的话扑哧一笑"}
{"time": 1767756199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340015497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至少实用性上，现有的结论体系大部分还是能正常运作的。不过和我们没什么关系啦”正说着，学院的正门已然近在眼前"}
{"time": 1767756274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910486118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抬起头，心里难免有些忐忑，抓着母亲手臂的手下意识握紧，一直深呼吸。"}
{"time": 1767756442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101001824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "以后就要在这里上课了啊 心里有一种说不出道不明的感觉"}
{"time": 1767756475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813400641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "学院大门是一座高约 20 米的巨型魔法拱门，散发着柔和的淡紫色光晕。拱门主体由深海黑耀石与月光水晶镶嵌而成，门柱上雕刻着许多细小的生物和自然元素图章，往上则是托举着巫师帽与皇冠的人形，但都低于门楣上雕刻着的阿拉德魔法的起源符号——泰拉星徽记与四大元素图腾。拱门两侧矗立着两座无面魔法师雕像，分别手持法杖与魔法书，从其上能感受到深不见底的魔力波动"}
{"time": 1767756584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436472136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呼...有点紧张..\"给自己鼓气的同时越过大门"}
{"time": 1767756935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843869063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "深呼吸，然后跟上"}
{"time": 1767757054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249113743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛等一下等一下，要凭证……”阿尼亚从衣袖里拿出一枚徽章，举到半途，就看见你毫无阻碍地穿过了那层无形的屏障。空气中只留下比水滴落入湖面更不显眼的一圈涟漪。与之相对的，伊恩则仿佛被一层透明的软膜拦下。不会硬的让你像感觉撞上了一面墙，但你越往前，阻力也便越强，半米之遥已经是你的极限"}
{"time": 1767757131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812257858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”只能暂时先停下了"}
{"time": 1767757215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649426632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊，啊？”阿尼亚合不上嘴地看着已经自顾自走进去的舒茉。这两天来你们还是第一次见到她毫不掩饰的惊讶"}
{"time": 1767757268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549393374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？舒茉是怎么进去的..”也有些吃惊"}
{"time": 1767757445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447277856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"停下脚步，回头看着他们，\"怎么了?发生什么了吗？\"眨眨眼，\"怎么都很惊讶的样子?\""}
{"time": 1767757619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253381017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就、呃……”阿尼亚放下徽章，抬手做推动的架势。能明显看出她的手似乎遇到了什么阻力——除非她其实是机械舞高手"}
{"time": 1767758019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573908314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊？\"意识到了什么，从门内往回走试试看"}
{"time": 1767758032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765988455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
{"time": 1767761109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752871239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡觉！）"}
{"time": 1767767730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666086304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你睡了吗？)"}
{"time": 1767767793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783404923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有啊）"}
{"time": 1767767869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381038170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573908314]完全没有被阻拦的感觉，只有余光看得见身侧的空气有些许扭曲"}
{"time": 1767767901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693867480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“难道舒茉其实早就是这里的学生了？”"}
{"time": 1767767928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240829447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在说什么，重点是徽章）"}
{"time": 1767768064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574389353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?不可能吧...\"回应伊恩的话，微微歪着脑袋，皱着眉，自己也有些不可置信，\"我第一次出远门诶...\"看向阿尼亚，希望她能解释一下"}
{"time": 1767768281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888613603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是，看我也没有答案啊”她盯着你，眼里的求知欲比你浓郁多了“这个防护层和身份完全没关系，要么靠徽章认证，要么……各科室主任和校长倒是各有各的手段能不受影响”"}
{"time": 1767768295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1824066012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你刚才一点感觉都没有？”"}
{"time": 1767768333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218906490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好神奇啊....”摸摸这个防护层"}
{"time": 1767768495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374418726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没...没吧？\"回身看着校门，\"这里好像有东西...能看见一点...\"自己完全不理解，\"呃...\"不知道要说什么"}
{"time": 1767768630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068643755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1218906490]多少有些柔性，不过靠力量当然没法破开"}
{"time": 1767768750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300223998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总、总之都先进去吧”她重新拿起徽章，浅紫色的光晕扩散，这层光幕与防护层接触的时候，就像一颗球要滚入帷幕之中，从底下掀开了一个角"}
{"time": 1767768776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332014750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟在她身后进去"}
{"time": 1767768809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237924900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这次也不走在前面了，安静地跟在其他人身后。"}
{"time": 1767768859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404168067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "慢慢走，直到和舒茉并肩，然后用手碰碰她的手，询问一下"}
{"time": 1767768891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685206550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当一辈子元素师？）"}
{"time": 1767768909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366098764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1767768926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339495771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你倒是问啊）"}
{"time": 1767768938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326731952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（意思是能不能牵手（））"}
{"time": 1767768980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132906467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哦)"}
{"time": 1767768986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214005795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么个询问)"}
{"time": 1767769091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276840627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "本来还在想心事，感觉到触感偏过头看看，不觉笑了出来，摇摇脑袋晃掉繁杂的思绪，递出手"}
{"time": 1767769202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647335710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "顺势牵起，感觉心中对未来的迷茫稍微少了些，不过以后和舒茉不是一个专业的话，相见的时间会不会少很多.....哎，还是得多把握当下啊"}
{"time": 1767769348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947397046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（拿到手了没什么反应吗？）"}
{"time": 1767769474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324715912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“先去测试吧，然后……这个情况，应该是值得请一位主任来亲自看看的”阿尼亚一边说着，一边带着你们快步穿过立着先贤雕像的学院广场，朝着元素科的大楼走去"}
{"time": 1767769540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878654016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"本来放松了一些，这下又有些猝不及防的担忧，\"主任...会不会太...郑重了...没必要吧...\""}
{"time": 1767769750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563485673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么会？这说明同学你潜力无限嘛，哈哈”她的声音里隐隐带着些兴奋“如果评估完发现你是什么特殊体质的话，说不定会给你单独制定培养计划呢。”"}
{"time": 1767769798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704793392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，那我可得提前恭喜舒茉啦”"}
{"time": 1767769852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339580531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一来替舒茉伤悲）"}
{"time": 1767769871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148468030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是还没确定的事怎么就恭喜上了）"}
{"time": 1767769989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330669213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"别...\"有些扭捏，\"很特殊之类的事情...没有想过...\"咬着唇"}
{"time": 1767770071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480019377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1148468030]（hh）"}
{"time": 1767770143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403349471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一来为)"}
{"time": 1767770159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2002635223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我一直都觉得舒茉很特别啦，自信一点...”手稍稍用力试图给她点信心"}
{"time": 1767770218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528994561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"深呼吸，手也握紧了一些，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1767770288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035908578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有和主任接触的机会，当然是好事了”舒蕾握起舒茉的另一只手“不说特不特殊，如果有天赋的话，为什么要埋没呢？”"}
{"time": 1767770398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285337367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我已经知道占星科主任叫什么了）"}
{"time": 1767770411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537689808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不会是)"}
{"time": 1767770418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089483690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(玛丽斯比例吧)"}
{"time": 1767770426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272790478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那也太邪恶了）"}
{"time": 1767770428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989089647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是天宫安吗（）"}
{"time": 1767770435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143911010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说的克里斯滕）"}
{"time": 1767770445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297182007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1989089647]（那很可惜了（）"}
{"time": 1767770452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840637995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那很可惜了)"}
{"time": 1767770493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913327669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我确实没想好元素科主任）"}
{"time": 1767770538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247481330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2035908578]\"嗯。\"缓了缓心神，虽然依然有些紧张，不过双手都被握住，感觉到支撑的现在...应该，没问题。"}
{"time": 1767770588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331426992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(艾雅法拉吧大概)"}
{"time": 1767770629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169687940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（单属性太区了，我还不如找个煌黑龙娘）"}
{"time": 1767770753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055328954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(煌黑龙的名字有点阳刚的)"}
{"time": 1767770796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912509796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实上一个所有种类查克拉都有的人叫，旗木卡卡西)"}
{"time": 1767770797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414674762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怕你不知道，煌黑龙学名带艾拉）"}
{"time": 1767770835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098084689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦是艾尔）"}
{"time": 1767770837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1303295358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那没事了）"}
