{"time": 1767785705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600299720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我看迦南学院里全是超雄啊）"}
{"time": 1767785741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922150255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实就是天焚练气塔发射器）"}
{"time": 1767785760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177989477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这学院纯放养啊）"}
{"time": 1767785881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332276720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(主要是，对萧炎没啥帮助吧)"}
{"time": 1767785895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996339079", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你看有人练焚决吧)"}
{"time": 1767785900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799501756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你看有人练焚决吗)"}
{"time": 1767786006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841935636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=490661719]看你们也没别的要问，能量体也就消散地干脆。阿尼亚吁了口气，看向你们这边“咳……几位还有什么问题吗？”"}
{"time": 1767786254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763075650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...阿尼亚姐姐看上去怎么这么紧张?\"眨眨眼，揉揉手心，藏住刚刚出的汗。"}
{"time": 1767786561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266590074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊哈，没有的事”她尬笑着摆摆手“只是我也很少和主任近距离相处……”"}
{"time": 1767786700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487442928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"主任看上去也不是很难相处的人...?\"对这一点暂且持保留态度，\"现在我也是元素科的学生了，师姐，不会元素魔法...呃，可以吗？\""}
{"time": 1767787143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125308295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个无所谓啊，入学时只有魔力、完全没使用过魔法的学生年年都有。”她十指交叉，看起来自在了不少“元素魔法入门很简单的，因为元素魔力天然存在于自然中，不像占星科和精神科，需要仔细感应沟通。”"}
{"time": 1767787382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190995282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而元素科的理论体系也是最完善、最直观的。很多基础魔法都是一看就会的。”"}
{"time": 1767787453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209302869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...那之后就要拜托师姐指导我一些了呢。\"看见她放松下来，自己也跟着放松下来，\"另外...宿舍的事...?\""}
{"time": 1767787614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "124637775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个还没这么快啦，现在还在扩招期……你们的学期还要过几天才会正式开始呢。”她伸手，大概是找你要你的报名单“通行校徽和录取通知书到时候会一起寄到你们填的住址的。”"}
{"time": 1767787752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116331171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，如果你问的是人数，我们学校是四人间哦”"}
{"time": 1767787804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762458693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我一想到入学学的第一个魔法会是什么就想笑了）"}
{"time": 1767787809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698730699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把签过名的报名单递给她，\"麻烦师姐了。\""}
{"time": 1767787812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778845923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(火球术?)"}
{"time": 1767787816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689616144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说是元素视野）"}
{"time": 1767787825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866939066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（本质是阅读魔法）"}
{"time": 1767788221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20008578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(侦测魔法是吧)"}
{"time": 1767788308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114154161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还好……啦，怎么想都是卡坤的问题……”阿尼亚的脸色不太自然“我只想当个助教，不该负责招生的”"}
{"time": 1767788800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974786019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...还是麻烦师姐了。\"点点头，\"那今天我们就...回去了?\""}
{"time": 1767788891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509724207", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧，其实也不是我想当，莫名其妙就到了这个位置而已”她清了清嗓子“我送你们出去吧”"}
{"time": 1767789030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519361769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦他妈的不对）"}
