{"time": 1767789189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659209770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...要去找米拉教授?\"在发生的事情的后劲里想起了这回事，\"伊恩?\""}
