{"time": 1767809753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313962555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1767809999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1427320171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "走廊和装饰的印象色逐渐向紫色过渡，变暗的不仅有环境，还有空气中的魔力配比。跨过两根紫色珊瑚标定的边界，便是暗元素办公走廊的所在"}
{"time": 1767810187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201072716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想来应该是伊恩要去和教授交流，刻意放慢了一些脚步，\"我在外面等着吧？\""}
{"time": 1767810198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042945221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "伊恩并没有对阴暗的环境和被一家独大的魔力包围感到不适，相反有些怡然自得。"}
{"time": 1767810313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870892979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=201072716][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “一起也行吧”看看阿尼亚怎么说"}
{"time": 1767810457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508515644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“主任没说不行……”"}
{"time": 1767810484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815517182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉陪我一起去吧...”"}
{"time": 1767810545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416500982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"点点头，\"既然我也是...元素科的学生的话...应该没问题吧...\""}
{"time": 1767810726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570589220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，那……”阿尼亚点点头，上前去敲了敲门“米拉教授，有个新生需要您的指导。”"}
{"time": 1767811117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048888691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“进来。”门内的声音听起来不是很有精神"}
{"time": 1767811150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721898748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把自己的身位落在最后一个，推一推伊恩、"}
{"time": 1767811201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175372175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有舒茉在身旁，倒也不是很紧张，走上前去，轻轻打开门“打扰了，米拉教授，主任让我来找您”"}
{"time": 1767811654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41708133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "门内的装饰倒是出人意料的精致。门旁暗色的烛台没点着，地板上铺着大片毛绒绒的黑色长绒地毯，不论谁走进去脚步声都会顷刻缄默，不过也有个坏处，窝在上面睡觉黑猫总会冷不丁绊你一脚……好在至少进门的时候不会。但桌对面的黑发女人轻念了句什么，你突然就能看清黑暗中的细节了"}
{"time": 1767811724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871546577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害....”不自觉的就说出来了“米拉教授您好，我叫伊恩”"}
{"time": 1767811814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227536021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"教授您好...我叫舒茉...\""}
{"time": 1767812029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051756987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“主任叫你来的？”桌后的人侧过身，脑袋绕过桌上摆着的大片文书。一头平直如水的长发有一半搭在肩膀上，顺便遮住了她的左眼“哦，黑暗之眼啊。”"}
{"time": 1767812087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950382958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她的语调一直提不起什么精神，就连说出那四个字时也是如此，不知道是不是真的觉得无关痛痒"}
{"time": 1767812133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391990267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..”不愧是魔法学院的人，果然见多识广“那教授..你有什么建议吗..”"}
{"time": 1767812155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785688294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在伊恩身后，不作声"}
{"time": 1767812252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597285777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（建议不是看你想干什么吗）"}
{"time": 1767812331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708850082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“教授..我感觉最近我好像到了瓶颈，不知道该怎么继续提升了..”"}
{"time": 1767812369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547137023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哦，提起这个才发现好像我也是)"}
{"time": 1767812602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560092765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“正常。”她缩了回去，你听见翻书的声音“黑暗之眼是馈赠，也是考验。你不赢过它，就只会反受其害”"}
{"time": 1767812743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933241702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你要是怕这定时炸弹，我也可以帮你摘了，以后就当个普通魔法师”"}
{"time": 1767812769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823609517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“摘了？真的可以摘吗....”感觉有点不太靠谱的样子"}
{"time": 1767812842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465709348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抬起头看着对方，自己当然不会影响伊恩做决定，静静看着"}
{"time": 1767812941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235979013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“换个心脏而已，没什么大不了的。最多最开始的几年有点不习惯”她的语气平淡，好像在说一件微不足道的事"}
{"time": 1767813124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457989460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1823609517]（为什么要问.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767813127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747989434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个考验，我具体该怎么做”换心脏什么的怎么听都不太妙，而且自己要是变成普通魔法师的话...真的还能..摇摇头，果然还是不能放弃啊"}
{"time": 1767813129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005628530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还能骗你吗）"}
