{"time": 1767813325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366073182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不管你做出什么决定...\"双手从后面握住他的手"}
{"time": 1767813447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119717815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“以防你还有侥幸心理”不知道她觉得你是怎么想的“和黑暗之眼共生，也不是什么轻易就能反悔的事”"}
{"time": 1767813726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644817804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过你的黑暗之眼位置特殊，除了彻底驾驭和彻底抛弃，也没别的路可选。”"}
