{"time": 1767842328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822648544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天麻烦阿尼亚姐姐了。\"往校门外走，出门之后再回回头，\"拜拜。\""}
{"time": 1767842359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405687260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "从通道出去，然后转身看向阿尼亚“阿尼亚姐姐再见”"}
{"time": 1767842386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072182023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她简单道别之后也回去了"}
{"time": 1767842480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500618039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾自然也回身行礼“多谢阿尼亚小姐，今天真是打扰了”"}
{"time": 1767842736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910419724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，虽然说上去很轻巧...不过元素科...摇摇头，暂且抛开这些繁杂的思绪，\"回家吧。\""}
{"time": 1767843167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365524711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……啊，是不是还没吃午饭？”舒蕾有些后知后觉似的开口，一抬头，太阳早已过了天中，向西斜了有一会了"}
{"time": 1767843286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454895162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道汉斯叔叔吃了没”"}
