{"time": 1767861240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962015115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我还是第一次住进宿舍这种地方，有点害怕啦，不过...也很期待。\""}
{"time": 1767861310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371682634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己从小就辗转各家，所以也不是很担心人际交往“没事啦，舒茉肯定会很受欢迎的”"}
{"time": 1767861405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149870677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（难说.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767861595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245390652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，反正你们周末会有休息日的，对吧？那时候都可以回家来……其实平时也可以”舒蕾在街上物色着饭店“反正也不远嘛，家里只有我和你爸的话，怪冷清的”"}
{"time": 1767861712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772207797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"知道啦。\"不需要离家太远去上学的话，大概确实也算很有余裕了。"}
{"time": 1767861803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463982312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也不知道学院的课程紧不紧...”"}
