{"time": 1767861953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227660160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉会很难诶...我什么都不会。\""}
{"time": 1767861977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807153581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "下午茶稀疏平常，回家的路上又添置了些日用品和厨具。可惜早晨没有连食材一块采买，这个点菜市场已经不剩什么好货了。你们回到家中，汉斯不在，先前买的器具已经被归置到了趁手的地方，垃圾和灰尘也被清扫干净，看着就叫人心情畅快"}
{"time": 1767862032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594263530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...没关系啦，我和舒茉算同一起跑线上的人，到时候我们互帮互助”"}
{"time": 1767862065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600697893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“汉斯叔叔真能干啊”忍不住夸赞道"}
{"time": 1767862261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584522189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呀，才知道？”舒蕾拿起桌上的便签看了看“他找工作去了，不过晚饭应该还是会回来的”"}
{"time": 1767862329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794723152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露出笑容，毕竟记忆里爸爸一直都是这样嘛。\"我也收拾一下我的行李啦，到现在还没拿出来过。\"回房间拆封自己的行李包，分门归类，当然大部分应该是衣服。"}
{"time": 1767862534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022803059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大部分都是最近新添置的衣物。毕竟先前逃离的比较仓促。不过没带上的，本来也有一部分快要穿不下了"}
{"time": 1767862872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64564704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着虽然不算满满当当，但也填充了大部分的衣柜，心情愉快，倒在床上，看着窗外的天空，久违的悠闲涌上心头。"}
{"time": 1767863387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075186775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人呢[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1767863392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393897853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还在灼热射线）"}
{"time": 1767864181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074931578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“下午有什么计划吗”询问舒茉"}
{"time": 1767864277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52327544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"下午...没有诶。\"在床上偏过头看向伊恩，\"伊恩有吗？\""}
{"time": 1767865858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "94449476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(so?还在幻想)"}
{"time": 1767865882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864130419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我想去看看那座塔....”"}
{"time": 1767865910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196655224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且以后考试可能也会有实战相关？提前去适应一下”"}
{"time": 1767866014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463701033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，我们现在去那座塔吗？\"从床上坐起来，\"可以吗？我们才刚入学...理论什么都一窍不通诶\""}
{"time": 1767866121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123221905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"理论是可以慢慢学习的...但实战这块应该只能靠自己了\""}
{"time": 1767866150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424306464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“万一到时候别人都身经百战，我们还只是个小白...就不好了”"}
{"time": 1767866222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885275886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"课程应该会教给我们的吧...而且到时候会有老师带着一起。\"纠结，\"我们独自去的话...遇到危险的话...\""}
