{"time": 1767869736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114995461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（仔细一想，海贼王主角团没几个人有妈妈，有的好像还都死了）"}
{"time": 1767869755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008365536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有家人很难冒险的啦，不过进学院可能有什么实践课吧)"}
{"time": 1767869758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209059689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别说妈妈了，有几个有家人的）"}
